ck proof I thought it was  interesting how Aaron from BRD sort of  put it into perspective for us yeah it's  it's pretty mind-blowing so  if you were to take so the this these 12  words this sort of root password if you  will each each slot has I think it's  2048 available words so there's a word  list and then it's one of these 2000  words for each slot now if you ask a  computer to crack a one-word password  that's 2000 words possibility it's gonna  take a fraction of a fraction of a  second so it is with two words or three  words or four words but when you get to  twelve words you're looking at crazy  numbers such as if we turn if we took  all the matter in our solar system and  turn it into a supercomputer a thousand  times as efficient as the best computer  we have today and let it run until the  heat death of the universe it still  would not crack your password so we get  into some really astronomical numbers  that are almost impossible to comprehend  but the short the short version is it's  secure and BRD is just as useful for  anyone who does have a lot of experience  with crypto because BRD offers just  about anything you'd want in a platform  that offers these types of services they  just do it in a really sleek and  straightforward way that makes it easier  to use it's one of the oldest and  largest crypto wallets in the world it  was founded in 2014 it was the first  Bitcoin wallet in the iOS App Store ever  these guys have been around for a while  they know what they're doing and today  BRD has over two million users and over  six billion dollars in cryptocurrency is  being stored on the platform as of right  now the app is more popular than ever  the last quarter of 2018 was their  biggest quarter ever almost 400,000 new  users and in 2018 last year they doubled  their user base users from more than 170  countries are on the app available in 14  languages top 50 finance app in the App  Store in major regions like the US UK  and Canada and it's a top 10